{"result":{"status":200,"page":"dolgb","data":{"userDefinedFilter":{},"items":[{"introduction":"Semolina sourdough bread is so tasty. It's one of my very favorite to make for dinner. I love what the hard semolina flour does to the texture and color of this bread. It's moist and light with a slightly chewy crust and the semolina gives it a warm inviting yellow color. It's yummy with butter or dipped in your favorite olive oil and balsamic vinegar. This bread would make excellent French Toast too.","servings":"10-12","photo":"image://v1/577c92_65effd8e06744a569d32d81bb273b1c8~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/4032_3024/20170401_162146.jpg","link-recipes-1-title":"/bread-and-sourdough/simple-semolina-sourdough-bread","url":"http://www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/04/10/Simply-Semolina-Bread","image":"wix:image://v1/577c92_65effd8e06744a569d32d81bb273b1c8~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg/20170401_162146.jpg#originWidth=4032&originHeight=3024","_id":"39f7fa60-2d3e-43b6-9395-fe37dde675b7","_owner":"577c92d8-55f7-4f98-88a2-d8647b1c2c9c","_createdDate":{"$date":"2023-02-17T18:37:31.240Z"},"title1":"Simple Semolina Sourdough Bread","shortDescription":"Semolina sourdough bread is so tasty. It's one of my very favorite to make for dinner. I love what the hard semolina flour does to the texture and color of this bread. It's moist and light with a slightly chewy crust and the semolina gives it a warm inviting yellow color. It's yummy with butter or dipped in your favorite olive oil and balsamic vinegar. This bread would make excellent French Toast too.","link-recipes-1-all":"/recipes-1/","cookingTime":"40 minutes","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2023-02-18T22:34:28.981Z"},"recipesCatagoryCatagory":"/Recipes/catagory/Bread","preparationTime":"3 hours","ingredients":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"foo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"3 1/2 cups All Purpose Flour ( I use ","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"background":"var(--ricos-custom-p-background-